// pa_requestPasswordAction (setup/reset password) and
// pa_requestLoginLink (passwordless magic link). Both funnel through
// pa_buildBrandedEmailHtml_ so the visual design lives in one place;
// only the copy/button text differ per email type. The action link is
// still a real <a href="..."> — see the pa_sendMail_ comment above for
// why that matters for the long token URL surviving mail-client line
// wrapping.
